// Signing.xcconfig
//
// Override signing settings for real-device builds.
// Copy this to Signing.local.xcconfig and fill in your team ID.
// Signing.local.xcconfig is gitignored and never committed.
//
// To find your team ID:
//   1. Open Xcode > Settings > Accounts
//   2. Select your Apple ID, then your team
//   3. The Team ID is the 10-character alphanumeric string
//
// Alternatively, run:
//   security find-identity -v -p codesigning

// DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = YOUR_TEAM_ID_HERE
